{"asset_key":"ep5/env_story_15344180","episode":"ep5","category":"env_story","story_id":"15344180","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1534418001:0":{"text":"すべてのヤクボルの勇士は、旅に出なくてはならない。そして終点に辿り着いた者だけが、貴重な宝を手にすることができる。","source_cn":"每一位雅库伯尔的勇士，都要踏上一场寻宝之旅。当勇士抵达...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC58D9382A86F7DD0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1534418002:0":{"text":"それは決して楽な道のりではない。忍耐と勇気、そして知恵が試される試練の旅なのだ。","source_cn":"但寻宝之旅并不是轻松的旅途，而是对耐心、勇气、智慧的考验。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3CB009C445C3525F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1534418003:0":{"text":"今回は、今まさに宝探しの旅に出ようとしている一人の勇士の物語……","source_cn":"这次故事的主角，就是一个即将踏上寻宝之旅的勇士……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFB8F46008274E3A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:老兽人暗眼":{"text":"獣人のダルカイ","source":"老兽人暗眼","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}